```mdl
verdict UpdateStatus: The status union lives in app-toolkit and adds a dev kind the spec does not list.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/app-toolkit/src/app/AppUpdate.ts#Status]
  note: |
    `AppUpdate.Status` has every spec literal plus `dev` (a supported platform served by a dev server).
    plugin-native only re-exports it from `types/Update.ts`.
```

```mdl
verdict UpdateState: The state is a discriminated union carrying the spec's per-kind fields.
