    Modelled as one union (`Status`) rather than a struct with optional fields; `progress.unit` is
    `'bytes' | 'entries'` because the web platform shares it. No test.
```

```mdl
verdict NativeSettings: The updates row exists but the component takes no settings props.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/src/containers/NativeSettings/NativeSettings.tsx#NativeSettings, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/app-toolkit/src/ui/hooks/useUpdateRow.tsx#useUpdateRow]
  walkthrough:
    - The container reads the UpdateManager capability and renders one Updates field. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/src/containers/NativeSettings/NativeSettings.tsx#NativeSettings
    - The shared hook holds the pending state and maps each status to a description and Check / Update / Relaunch button. github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/app-toolkit/src/ui/hooks/useUpdateRow.tsx#useUpdateRow
  note: |
    Status, pending state and the three actions match, via the shared `useUpdateRow`. The `settings` and
    `onSettingsChange` props do not exist (the component takes none). No test or story.
```

```mdl
verdict CheckForUpdate: Implemented as UpdateManager.check, not as an operation.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/src/capabilities/updater.ts]
  note: |
    `manager.check` sets checking, then up-to-date / available / failed, and no-ops when OTA is disabled
    (`SUPPORTS_OTA` plus the port check). It is a capability method, not an `Operation.make`. No test.
```

```mdl
verdict InstallUpdate: Implemented as UpdateManager.install, streaming byte progress, without relaunch.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/src/capabilities/updater.ts]
  note: `doInstall` streams Started/Progress events to the atom and ends in ready or failed; it returns early with no cached pending update. A capability method, not an operation. No test.
```

```mdl
