```mdl
verdict F-3.1: Ollama spawns as a shell command on port 21434, lazily on first use, not on SetupAiServiceProviders.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/src/capabilities/ollama.ts#OllamaSidecarLive, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-native/dx.config.ts]
  note: |
    The module activates on `ActivationEvents.Startup` (the index comment explains why), and the process
    spawns when the managed runtime first forces `OllamaSidecar`. It is `Command.create('ollama')`, not a
    Tauri sidecar binary.
```

